        // session's own index so paired-reply emission
        // (publishEventgroupNotify, handleServerResponse) routes back
        // to the raising session — critical for SOME/IP server pool
        // (SCE_MESH.md §14.4), a no-op degeneracy for every
        // non-pool router (N_SESSIONS == 1).
